[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11221.91, "timestamp": "03:07:01", "text": "知らず知らずのうちに、あるいは何かが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11224.23, "timestamp": "03:07:04", "text": "彼氏はそれを気に入らなかった。彼氏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11226.55, "timestamp": "03:07:06", "text": "新しい相手に怒り始める"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11230.389, "timestamp": "03:07:10", "text": "男。もう一人の男が始める、えーと始める"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11232.63, "timestamp": "03:07:12", "text": "反撃する、といった感じだ。両方とも"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11234.896, "timestamp": "03:07:14", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "dayum. just like kronos"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11234.95, "timestamp": "03:07:14", "text": "互いに罵り合っていた。そしてその少女は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11236.609, "timestamp": "03:07:16", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lmaoo"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11238.71, "timestamp": "03:07:18", "text": "泣き始めて、女の子たちは「えー」って感じだった"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11238.944, "timestamp": "03:07:18", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11249.67, "timestamp": "03:07:29", "text": "そしてコメント欄では、人々は「えー」という感じでした。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11253.11, "timestamp": "03:07:33", "text": "手を叩いて、いいね、いいね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11256.79, "timestamp": "03:07:36", "text": "そういう言い回しのこと。そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11258.87, "timestamp": "03:07:38", "text": "人々は「電話して」といったコメントを寄せた。これ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11259.101, "timestamp": "03:07:39", "author": "@Ninja477", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/DgHpXlaDuDSPk2w40fljKZE0ZpWffCKDHKYfP2DNO6YWP5QEr5mBRcLrJDjF8KH0euY0GnYAF6c=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "entertainment"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11261.429, "timestamp": "03:07:41", "text": "あの女の子に僕の電話番号を教えたんだ。そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11264.23, "timestamp": "03:07:44", "text": "すべて。ええと、他の人たち"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11267.03, "timestamp": "03:07:47", "text": "コメントは、えっと、口説こうとしてる感じだった"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11267.512, "timestamp": "03:07:47", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i've always finded it cringe....all of em"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11269.75, "timestamp": "03:07:49", "text": "そして、あの女の子を手に入れるとか、何かするんだ。私はしません"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11271.237, "timestamp": "03:07:51", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "even tiktok"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11272.91, "timestamp": "03:07:52", "text": "奇妙な文化を終わらせる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11275.83, "timestamp": "03:07:55", "text": "そこには。つまり、モッドのライブストリームは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11277.91, "timestamp": "03:07:57", "text": "私の動画はYouTubeにあります。見てもいいですよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11279.71, "timestamp": "03:07:59", "text": "それは信じがたい"}]